pick of PR #121647 and its follow-up PR #121719 to ensure that the commit is atomically correct.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWhen additional C++ modules are added to the Godot 4.7 branch (current stable), the same problem described in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109158 occurs. It's simply a matter of repo size. @WhalesState encountered this problem earlier in 4.5, and I am seeing this problem in godot-dimensions as well. I believe we should cherry-pick this change to all supported branches in order to fix all of them and enable users to extend Godot arbitrarily without running into this limitation.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI've had this problem for a long time in godot-dimensions, but haven't bothered investigating too deeply. When I saw that the problem was fixed in master, I used AI to search for the commits responsible for fixing it, in order to find these PRs so we can cherry-pick this. The lines of code themselves are entirely authored by @Repiteo.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6132313027,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbYOrww","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.2","name":"cherrypick:4.2","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.2.x release","color":"44669